<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src data:; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light; }
body { margin: 0; padding: 24px 32px; font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif; color: #1f2933; background: #f7f9fb; }
header { border-bottom: 2px solid #2f5d8a; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 6px 0; }
h2 { font-size: 16px; margin: 24px 0 8px 0; color: #2f5d8a; }
.meta { font-size: 12px; color: #52606d; }
.cards { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; min-width: 150px; }
.card .label { font-size: 12px; color: #52606d; }
.card .value { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; background: #ffffff; font-size: 12px; }
th, td { border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; padding: 5px 8px; text-align: right; }
th { background: #eef2f7; text-align: center; }
td.left, th.left { text-align: left; }
svg { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; border-radius: 6px; }
footer { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 12px; color: #7b8794; border-top: 1px solid #d9e2ec; padding-top: 10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<div class="meta">生成时间（UTC）：{{ generated_at }} ｜ 语料标识：{{ corpus_content_sha256[:16] }} ｜ 参考生成器：T0.5 计时协议</div>
<div class="meta">本页面为固定合成参考件：非 P6 正式报告，不含真实账户、配置或生产数据。</div>
</header>

<section class="cards">
{% for card in cards %}
<div class="card"><div class="label">{{ card.label }}</div><div class="value">{{ card.value }}</div></div>
{% endfor %}
</section>

<h2>持仓参考（前 {{ positions|length }} 行）</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th class="left">代码</th><th>股数</th><th>买入价</th><th>成本额</th><th>买入日</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in positions %}
<tr><td class="left">{{ row.ts_code }}</td><td>{{ row.shares }}</td><td>{{ row.buy_price }}</td><td>{{ row.buy_cost }}</td><td>{{ row.buy_date }}</td><td>{{ row.status }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>NAV 参考曲线（{{ nav_count }} 点，抽样 {{ nav_polyline_points }} 点）</h2>
<svg viewBox="0 0 720 180" width="100%" height="180" role="img" aria-label="NAV 参考曲线">
<polyline fill="none" stroke="#2f5d8a" stroke-width="2" points="{{ nav_polyline }}" />
</svg>

<h2>当日指令参考（前 {{ instructions|length }} 行）</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th class="left">代码</th><th>方向</th><th>股数</th><th>价格</th><th>金额</th><th>原因</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in instructions %}
<tr><td class="left">{{ row.ts_code }}</td><td>{{ row.action }}</td><td>{{ row.shares }}</td><td>{{ row.price }}</td><td>{{ row.amount }}</td><td>{{ row.reason }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>质量摘要（合成）</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th class="left">层级</th><th class="left">数据集</th><th>异常指标行</th><th>error</th><th>warning</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for row in quality %}
<tr><td class="left">{{ row.layer }}</td><td class="left">{{ row.dataset }}</td><td>{{ row.abnormal }}</td><td>{{ row.error }}</td><td>{{ row.warning }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>

<footer>参考生成器（P6 T0.5）：只验证生成计时与体积/离线协议，不代表 P6 报告实现已验收。</footer>
</body>
</html>
